    "detailed_description": "<strong>Developed with teachers and educators</strong>, minitechno is for kids of all ages to play, develop and learn safely across 5 activities.<br><br>No ads. No subscription. No additional purchases. No account necessary. No internet connection required. No tracking. AND FREE UPDATES!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sandbox</h2>To explore physics and construction<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680080/extras/c7d143a717b97f1ddacae27bd0e93a94.avif?t=1720307100\" width=500 height=90 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Piano</h2>A single and dual multi-sound musical keyboard<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680080/extras/94d28f69a03269d5e311a9e551f7f9d0.avif?t=1720307100\" width=500 height=90 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FlashTap</h2>For the development of reflexes and coordination<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680080/extras/2749f7a29c201cdeb7320617c6d313ea.avif?t=1720307100\" width=500 height=90 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vocakey</h2>To help with the association of letters and numbers on a keyboard<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680080/extras/19b65fad37e615b9688b2e50c6c2fbc0.avif?t=1720307100\" width=500 height=90 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Techno ABC</h2>An ABC with tech rhymes and illustrations<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680080/extras/56ec01037ddd7bc73015c86cf81b88c4.avif?t=1720307100\" width=500 height=83 /></span><br><br>A complete guide with recommendations for both little ones and bigger ones is available for parents in the app. Version 1.2 introduced a new settings panel with 4x more options for parents.<br><br>The entire app is bilingual and switchable instantaneously with an always available switch that can be disabled.<br><br>For tablets and phones. Supports touch, mouse and keyboard.<br><br>You can learn more about our design and development process for minitechno with a fully transparent Privacy policy on our website.",
