w settings panel with 4x more options for parents.<br><br>The entire app is bilingual and switchable instantaneously with an always available switch that can be disabled.<br><br>For tablets and phones. Supports touch, mouse and keyboard.<br><br>You can learn more about our design and development process for minitechno with a fully transparent Privacy policy on our website.",
